# Language statistics overrides for GitHub Linguist.
#
# The shipped product is the C++ library (include/ + src/ + apps/native) with
# its thin Python command surface. The research scaffolding below is archived
# phase-by-phase experiment history that is retained for provenance (its
# freeze records pin source SHA256 hashes, so the files must stay byte-stable
# and in place) but is not part of the library surface. Exclude it from
# GitHub's language breakdown so the reported primary language reflects the
# C++ core.

# Archived smartphone phase harnesses and their launch/evaluation wrappers.
apps/commands/benchmarks/gnss_smartphone_phase*.py linguist-vendored
tests/test_smartphone_phase*.py                   linguist-vendored

# One-off research analysis and experiment drivers (not shipped commands).
scripts/analysis/**    linguist-vendored
scripts/experiments/** linguist-vendored
